<!--
  Why:  §21.6 puts every user-visible string in resources — a hardcoded one cannot be translated
        and cannot be checked for length at 200% font. `CfoHardcodedUiString` (issue 1.5) fails the
        build on a literal in a :feature:* composable, so this file is not optional.
  What: the accounts list, the editor, and the eleven FR-ACC-001 type labels.
  Result: the whole feature's copy in one reviewable place.
  Changelog: 2026-07-28 — Created for issue 2.5.
-->
